OL,3,GNEWSATwo charged after discovery of
OL,4,A'explosives' at home
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been charged with
OL,7,Fmaking threats to kill after three
OL,8,F"small homemade explosive devices" were
OL,9,Ffound at a house.
OL,11,FEssex Police made the discovery after
OL,12,Fforcing entry to a home in Sawyers
OL,13,FGrove, Brentwood, on Friday morning.
OL,15,FIt led to 40 properties being evacuated
OL,16,Fand a 100m (328ft) cordon being imposed
OL,17,Fin the area.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
