OL,3,GNEWSATwo charged after discovery of
OL,4,A'explosives' at home
OL,5,
OL,6,FThomas Walker, 43, and Yolanda-Tony
OL,7,FKing, 48, both of Sawyers Grove, have
OL,8,Fbeen charged with criminal damage and
OL,9,Fmaking threats to kill, and were due
OL,10,Fbefore magistrates in Basildon on
OL,11,FMonday. Police said investigations into
OL,12,Fthe suspicious items were continuing.
